==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Cosmic Eclipse|Aipom|169}} from the {{TCG|Cosmic Eclipse}} expansion.
*'''Tail Jab''' is a move that first appeared in {{TCG ID|Steam Siege|Aipom|90}} from the {{TCG|Steam Siege}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Sun}}.

